  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "마침 잘 만났다!\n너, 꽤 잘나가는 트레이너지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9C8CE680020C7980020B9CCB0ACB2E40021000AB108002C0020AF640020C798B098AC00B2940020D2B8B808C774B108C9C0003F00100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우리도 제법 잘나가거든!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n요즘 빠져 있는 전법 덕분에\n어떤 포켓몬 승부에서도 연전연승 중이지!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0B9ACB3C40020C81CBC950020C798B098AC00AC70B4E0002100100001BE01000AC694C9980020BE60C8380020C788B2940020C804BC950020B355BD84C5D0000AC5B4B5A40020D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80C5D0C11CB3C40020C5F0C804C5F0C2B90020C911C774C9C0002100100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우리의 비결은 바로\n변화 기술이야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0B9ACC7580020BE44ACB0C7400020BC14B85C000ABCC0D6540020AE30C220C774C57C002100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "변화 기술로\n자신의 포켓몬을 강하게 만들고!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCC0D6540020AE30C220B85C000AC790C2E0C7580020D3ECCF13BAACC7440020AC15D558AC8C0020B9CCB4E4ACE0002100100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "변화 기술로\n상대의 포켓몬을 약하게 만든다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCC0D6540020AE30C220B85C000AC0C1B300C7580020D3ECCF13BAACC7440020C57DD558AC8C0020B9CCB4E0B2E4002100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "배틀은 데미지를 주는 게 전부가 아니라고!\n어때? 우리의 강력함을 맛보지 않겠어?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC30D2C0C7400020B370BBF8C9C0B97C0020C8FCB2940020AC8C0020C804BD80AC000020C544B2C8B77CACE00021000AC5B4B54C003F0020C6B0B9ACC7580020AC15B825D568C7440020B9DBBCF4C9C00020C54AACA0C5B4003F00100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너한테도 톡톡히\n맛보게 해 줄 테니까 말이야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108D55CD14CB3C40020D1A1D1A1D788000AB9DBBCF4AC8C0020D5740020C9040020D14CB2C8AE4C0020B9D0C774C57C002100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우리 둘의 변화 기술에 맞설 만한 무모함...\n아니, 용기가 있다면 얼마든지 상대해 줄게!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0B9AC0020B458C7580020BCC0D6540020AE30C220C5D00020B9DEC1240020B9CCD55C0020BB34BAA8D568002E002E002E000AC544B2C8002C0020C6A9AE30AC000020C788B2E4BA740020C5BCB9C8B4E0C9C00020C0C1B300D5740020C904AC8C002100100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우리와 승부하고 싶다면\n준비하고 말 걸어 줘.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0B9ACC6400020C2B9BD80D558ACE00020C2F6B2E4BA74000AC900BE44D558ACE00020B9D00020AC78C5B40020C918002E00100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬 승부라는 이름의 레이스를\n시작할 준비는 됐어?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B77CB2940020C774B984C7580020B808C774C2A4B97C000AC2DCC791D5600020C900BE44B2940020B410C5B4003F00100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부해요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D574C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "준비할게요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C900BE44D560AC8CC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "변화 기술을 다루는 자는\n슬로 스타터와 같은 거라<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n기다림은 익숙해.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCC0D6540020AE30C220C7440020B2E4B8E8B2940020C790B294000AC2ACB85C0020C2A4D0C0D130C6400020AC19C7400020AC70B77C00100001BE00000AAE30B2E4B9BCC7400020C775C219D574002E00100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내 포켓몬이 사용하는 변화 기술은\n자신의 능력을 올리지!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B40020D3ECCF13BAACC7740020C0ACC6A9D558B2940020BCC0D6540020AE30C220C740000AC790C2E0C7580020B2A5B825C7440020C62CB9ACC9C0002100100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부가 길어지면 길어질수록\n네 포켓몬은 궁지에 몰리게 될걸!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80AC000020AE38C5B4C9C0BA740020AE38C5B4C9C8C218B85D000AB1240020D3ECCF13BAACC7400020AD81C9C0C5D00020BAB0B9ACAC8C0020B420AC78002100100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "지금 우리는 최상의 컨디션이라구!\n연승 기록을 경신해 주겠어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C0AE080020C6B0B9ACB2940020CD5CC0C1C7580020CEE8B514C158C774B77CAD6C0021000AC5F0C2B90020AE30B85DC7440020ACBDC2E0D5740020C8FCACA0C5B4002100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "젠장!\n연승 기록이 깨졌잖아...!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C820C7A50021000AC5F0C2B90020AE30B85DC7740020AE68C84CC796C544002E002E002E002100100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아니, 아직 안 끝났어!\n콤비인 내가 이기면 계속 연승이라구!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544B2C8002C0020C544C9C10020C5480020B05DB0ACC5B40021000ACF64BE44C7780020B0B4AC000020C774AE30BA740020ACC4C18D0020C5F0C2B9C774B77CAD6C002100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그러니 다음 상대는 나야!\n연승 기록을 경신해 주겠어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ECB2C80020B2E4C74C0020C0C1B300B2940020B098C57C0021000AC5F0C2B90020AE30B85DC7440020ACBDC2E0D5740020C8FCACA0C5B4002100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내가 이기면 연승을 이어 갈 수 있어!\n그러니까 빨리 승부하자!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B4AC000020C774AE30BA740020C5F0C2B9C7440020C774C5B40020AC080020C2180020C788C5B40021000AADF8B7ECB2C8AE4C0020BE68B9AC0020C2B9BD80D558C790002100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부해요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D574C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "준비할게요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C900BE44D560AC8CC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "약해지는 게 두려운가 보구나.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C57DD574C9C0B2940020AC8C0020B450B824C6B4AC000020BCF4AD6CB098002E00100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내 포켓몬들의 특기인 변화 기술은\n상대 포켓몬의 능력을 떨어뜨리지!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B40020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4C7580020D2B9AE30C7780020BCC0D6540020AE30C220C740000AC0C1B3000020D3ECCF13BAACC7580020B2A5B825C7440020B5A8C5B4B728B9ACC9C0002100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다시 말해,\n평소처럼 싸울 수 없을 거란 뜻이야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4C2DC0020B9D0D574002C000AD3C9C18CCC98B7FC0020C2F8C6B80020C2180020C5C6C7440020AC70B7800020B73BC774C57C002100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우리는 둘이 합쳐서 연승 콤비!\n한 명이 진 것만으로는 진 게 아니라고!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0B9ACB2940020B458C7740020D569CCD0C11C0020C5F0C2B90020CF64BE440021000AD55C0020BA85C7740020C9C40020AC83B9CCC73CB85CB2940020C9C40020AC8C0020C544B2C8B77CACE0002100100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우리 둘의 변화 기술이\n통하지 않다니...!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0B9AC0020B458C7580020BCC0D6540020AE30C220C774000AD1B5D558C9C00020C54AB2E4B2C8002E002E002E002100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자신의 포켓몬을 강하게 만들어도...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C790C2E0C7580020D3ECCF13BAACC7440020AC15D558AC8C0020B9CCB4E4C5B4B3C4002E002E002E00100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "상대의 포켓몬을 약하게 만들어도...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0C1B300C7580020D3ECCF13BAACC7440020C57DD558AC8C0020B9CCB4E4C5B4B3C4002E002E002E00100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그것만으로는 이길 수 없는 건가...!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8AC83B9CCC73CB85CB2940020C774AE380020C2180020C5C6B2940020AC74AC00002E002E002E002100100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저기, 승부에 있어서\n중요한 게 뭔지 가르쳐 줄래?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800AE30002C0020C2B9BD80C5D00020C788C5B4C11C000AC911C694D55C0020AC8C0020BB54C9C00020AC00B974CCD00020C904B798003F00100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬을 믿는 것",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC7440020BBFFB2940020AC830000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬을 단련시키는 것",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC7440020B2E8B828C2DCD0A4B2940020AC830000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "확실히 일리가 있네.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D655C2E4D7880020C77CB9ACAC000020C788B124002E00100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "강화도 약화도 이기기 위한 수단일 뿐\n필승법은 아닌 거구나.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
